dapr4s-wasm-linker

This artifact is the linker of scala-wasm (https://github.com/scala-wasm/scala-wasm), a fork of Scala.js,
at its 1.22.1-wasm.6 release commit e24a46b6f1df14483a56c7c02b1787b68bae29a8, built with one patch by
dapr4s (scripts/wasm/patches/scala-wasm-params-via-memory.patch in https://github.com/sideeffffect/dapr4s):
WIT function params are passed through linear memory when their flattened count exceeds MAX_FLAT_PARAMS
(16), for both exports (lifting) and imports (lowering). Republished under dapr4s's coordinates. The
sources jar contains the patched sources.

